--- nextflow clean -
-after 	clean up runs executed after the specified one
-before 	clean up runs executed before the specified one
-but 	clean up all runs except the specified one
-dry-run 	print names of files to be removed without deleting them
-f 	force clean command
-force 	force clean command
-h 	print the command usage
-help 	print the command usage
-k 	remove only temporary files, keeping log entries and metadata
-keep-logs 	remove only temporary files, keeping log entries and metadata
-n 	print names of files to be removed without deleting them
-q 	do not print names of files removed
-quiet 	do not print names of files removed
